contentText:
During a recent appearance on Talk With Flee , Cam&#8217;ron and co-host Sen City were talking about sample clearances when Sen brought up Killa&#8217;s &#8220; Pull It &#8221; collab with DMX , and asked if he had any memorable stories he was willing to share about the late rapper.

That&#8217;s when Cam could barely keep himself together as he told a story about the time the two were staying in a hotel and X had allegedly set up a fight between his dog and a raccoon. &#8220;I was filming Paid in Full the same time he was filming [ Cradle 2 the Grave ] with Jet Li,&#8221; he began by saying, &#8220;We were both staying in the same hotel at the same time in Connecticut. And he had a dog, I can&#8217;t remember if it was Boomer or not — rest in peace, Boomer, you know he loved Boomer — but he had a dog in the hotel with him and we kept bumping into each other. And he&#8217;s like, &#8216;Yo, bro, what you doing later?&#8217; And I&#8217;m like, &#8216;I just gotta film, I&#8217;ll be back&#8217; and he said, &#8216;Oh, aight, good. You gonna be done by 7?&#8217; And I said, &#8216;Yeah, yeah, I&#8217;ll be back&#8217; and he said, &#8216;Oh, cool, 7:30 we gonna be at the back of the hotel. Boomer is gonna fight this raccoon.'&#8221; [ Ed. note: Billboard does not endorse animal fights. PETA considers staged animal fighting to be &#8220; cruel .&#8221;]

Adding, &#8220;How do you know where a raccoon gonna be at, at 7:30? How&#8217;d you set this match up with your dog and a raccoon to fight a n—a at 7:30 to where all parties are gonna be available to fight this raccoon.&#8221;

He then continued by saying that he ran into DMX the next day where he learned that the dog won the bout in easy fashion. &#8220;Then I remember seeing him the next day and he was like, &#8216;Yo, where you was at?&#8217; I said, &#8216;I forgot all about it, X. What happened? He f—ked him up?&#8217; He said, &#8216;Yeah, he f—ked him up. A f—kin&#8217; raccoon can&#8217;t fuck with my n—a.'&#8221;

&#8220;That&#8217;s probably the No. 1 story out of all the stories with DMX that stands out to me,&#8221; he continued. &#8220;This n—a knew where a raccoon was gonna be at, at a particular time, and he had everybody set up to see the fight. I actually missed it, but I heard that his dog won and s—t.&#8221;

